menu "Matter gateway"

    config ESP32_MATTER_GATEWAY_MAX_CONNECTIONS
        int "chip-tool-gw connections at once"
        default 4
        range 1 8
        help
            Each costs about 25 KB of PSRAM: a TLS session with 4 KB record
            buffers, frame buffers and a 6 KB task stack (full 16 KB buffers
            during the handshake).

endmenu
